## Summary

**Bug:** In `src/url_utils.ts`, the tracking-param loop had a `break` statement that exited after deleting the first present param, so only one tracking parameter was stripped per URL (e.g. `fbclid` survived when `utm_source` was removed).

**Fix:** Removed the `break` so the loop iterates through all of `TRACKING_PARAMS` and deletes every matching param.

**Ad-hoc verification:** Ran a temporary script (`hermes-verify-url_utils.ts`) against the changed behavior — a URL carrying all four tracking params plus a real `foo=bar`:

```
OUT: https://example.com/Path/?foo=bar
ALL PASS
```

All four tracking params stripped, `foo=bar` preserved, hostname lowercased. Temp script deleted afterward. This is ad-hoc verification of the specific behavior, not a suite run (no existing tests reference this file).

